    "text": "Independent code and art re-review provisionally pass. New 10x9 chambers with narrow 3.5px necks distinguish dugouts; through ports retain 8px protected zones. Timber reads mainly as edge lining and some uniform banks remain. Trench5a port5/NE+S blind-spur interpretation is provisional. Full-map/unit/runtime/seasonal integration and acceptance remain open."
  },
